sequenceDiagram
    actor S as Swapper
    participant R as DemoRouter
    participant PM as PoolManager — v4
    participant H as TrancheJITHook
    participant A as LendingPool — rest

    S->>R: swapExactIn(poolKey, zeroForOne, amountIn, minOut, hookData)
    R->>PM: swap(...)
    PM->>H: beforeSwap(hookData)
    H->>H: gates — active pool · quoteState ≠ Rest · cooldown
    H->>H: prices — pool slot0 vs oracle mid, maxPriceAge 300s
    H->>H: deviation ≤ maxDeviationBps
    H->>H: toxic? fee = baseFee + deviation × toxicityMultiplier, capped at MAX_FEE
    H->>H: EV gate — fee ≥ minEvBps, else revert NotEvPositive
    alt risk budget is 0 — senior escrow unfunded
        H-->>PM: revert JitUnavailable
    else funded
        H->>H: bucket-exact JIT size from amount-delta math, +1% buffer
        H->>H: seed value ≤ effectiveMaxDeploy(), else JitCapacityExceeded
        H->>A: withdraw USDC or equity from rest
        H->>PM: settle and seed one-sided transient range
        PM->>PM: swap executes inside the bucket
        PM->>H: afterSwap(...)
        H->>PM: remove liquidity
        PM-->>H: positive deltas become ERC-6909 claims
        H->>H: negative deltas paid from Aave (JitRangeExceeded reverts if price left range)
        H->>H: next flow redeems claims, unwindClaims() for keepers
    end
    R-->>S: output tokens
